    "chunk_text": "sunum: \u00feonne ge bletsion Israhela Clipion minne naman & ic bletsie hi. ISRAHELA bearn dydon neah \u00f0am \u00f0e Drihten him bebead \u00feurh Moysen. \u00d0A hi ut foron of Egypta lande, swa him God wissode, \u00f0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 Moyses to Iobabe his m\u00e6ge, He andswarode, & cw\u00e6\u00f0: Ne fare ic mid eow, ac ic gewende to minum earde \u00fe\u00e6r ic geboren w\u00e6s, & \u00feonne \u00f0u mid us cymst, we \u00fee sylla\u00f0 swa hw\u00e6t swa \u00f0\u00e6r selost bi\u00f0 of \u00feam \u00e6htum \u00f0e Drihten us Hi foron of Drihtnes munte \u00fereora daga f\u00e6reld, & Drihtnes earc for beforan him \u00f0ry dagas Drihtnes genip for ofer hi on d\u00e6g, \u00feonne hi foron. \u00d0onne seo earc w\u00e6s up ahafen, \u00f0onne cw\u00e6\u00fe Moyses: Aris, Drihten, & todrif \u00feine fynd, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0a fleon & \u00feonne heo aset w\u00e6s, he cw\u00e6\u00fe: Gewend Drihten to Israhela folce. GEMANG \u00f0am aras micel murcnung on \u00f0am folce ongean Drihten, & hi w\u00e6ron sarie for heora \u00dea clypode \u00fe\u00e6t folc to Moyse, & Moyses geb\u00e6d to Drihtne, & \u00fe\u00e6t fyr geswac. & he nemde \u00fe\u00e6re stowe naman, Onal, for \u00fean \u00fee Drihtnes fyr w\u00e6s \u00f0\u00e6r on\u00e6led ongean \u00fe\u00e6t folc. \u00d0\u00e6t gemengede folc wear\u00f0 gefylled mid gyfernysse, & s\u00e6ton & weopon mid Israhela folce, & We gemunon hu fela fixa we h\u00e6fdon to gyfe on Egypta lande, & we h\u00e6fdon cucume",
